<footer class="aidc-note"><p><a id="ab-next-lesson" href="/intelligence/aidc101/101-1/" data-copy="nextLesson">AIDC 101-1 · Electricity to intelligence →</a></p><p class="eyebrow" data-copy="learn">Learning experiment</p><h2 data-copy="question">If the transformer arrives three months earlier, how much earlier can the campus open?</h2><p data-copy="boundary">This is a teaching model, not a construction forecast. Fixed assumptions: site access in month 6; building and distribution ready in month 8; compute and network ready in month 9; one month for transformer installation and one month for integrated testing. Capacity ramp, procurement eligibility, demand and revenue are outside this model.</p><a href="/intelligence/hardware/deliverable-megawatts/" data-copy="related">From paper gigawatts to deliverable megawatts →</a></footer></section>

